{"title": "Rotten Reflux (Condition)", "pageid": 31336, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Rotten_Reflux_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack priority", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Necrotic Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Rotten Reflux</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Necrotic damage has spoiled Thisobald's special brew, letting him use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rotting_Regurgitation\" title=\"Rotting Regurgitation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rotting Regurgitation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rotting_Regurgitation\" title=\"Rotting Regurgitation\">Rotting Regurgitation</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">TWN_DISTILLERY_UNLOCK_NECRO</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:TWN_DISTILLERY_UNLOCK_NECRO+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:TWN_DISTILLERY_UNLOCK_NECRO+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">TWN_DISTILLERY_ELEM_STATUS</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CTWN_DISTILLERY_ELEM_STATUS%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CTWN_DISTILLERY_ELEM_STATUS%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 4\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ForceOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/ForceOverhead\">ForceOverhead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rotting_Regurgitation\" title=\"Rotting Regurgitation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rotting Regurgitation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rotting_Regurgitation\" title=\"Rotting Regurgitation\">Rotting Regurgitation</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>A sip from the Brewer's special booze causes him to vomit a necrotic fluid. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn.)</dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>TWN_DISTILLERY_ELEM_STATUS</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Acid_Reflux\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Reflux_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid Reflux (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid Reflux\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Reflux_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid Reflux (Condition)\">Acid Reflux</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Acid damage has spoiled Thisobald's special brew, letting him use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acidic_Regurgitation\" title=\"Acidic Regurgitation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Acid_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Acid_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Acid_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acidic Regurgitation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Acid_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acidic_Regurgitation\" title=\"Acidic Regurgitation\">Acidic Regurgitation</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Burning_Reflux\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Reflux_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning Reflux (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning Reflux\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Reflux_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning Reflux (Condition)\">Burning Reflux</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Fire damage has ignited Thisobald's special brew, letting him use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fiery_Regurgitation\" title=\"Fiery Regurgitation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fiery Regurgitation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fiery_Regurgitation\" title=\"Fiery Regurgitation\">Fiery Regurgitation</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Cold_Reflux\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Reflux_(Condition)\" title=\"Cold Reflux (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold Reflux\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Reflux_(Condition)\" title=\"Cold Reflux (Condition)\">Cold Reflux</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Cold damage has chilled Thisobald's special brew, letting him use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Icy_Regurgitation\" title=\"Icy Regurgitation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Generic_Cold_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Cold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Generic_Cold_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Cold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Generic_Cold_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Cold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Icy Regurgitation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Generic_Cold_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Cold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Generic_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Icy_Regurgitation\" title=\"Icy Regurgitation\">Icy Regurgitation</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Electrified_Reflux\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Reflux_(Condition)\" title=\"Electrified Reflux (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Electrified Reflux\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Reflux_(Condition)\" title=\"Electrified Reflux (Condition)\">Electrified Reflux</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Lightning damage has charged Thisobald's special brew, letting him use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Regurgitation\" title=\"Electrified Regurgitation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Electrified Regurgitation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Regurgitation\" title=\"Electrified Regurgitation\">Electrified Regurgitation</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Gaseous_Reflux\">\n\n<th scope=\"